seen by another swimmer who started to shout. \"You hear a lot about how intelligent dolphins are,\" said one Vero Beach local. \"But I've never heard of anything like this happening before. It's a real miracle.\u201d Caleb said: \u201cIf Angel could understand English, I would tell him that I love him.\""}], "coverimg": "engenn7le12ob07re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "  I can talk about nature and the animal world. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about local and international news.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about hypothetical situations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "When was the last time you read or heard about animals in the news? What was it about?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you think animals know when people are in trouble? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Let's read a news article!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": []}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " \nLet's read a news article - who is Angel?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "te